<title>CROATIA: Croatian money market steady.</title>
<headline>Croatian money market steady.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Croatian money market was steady on higher turnover on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;This is a huge offer and we expect even a bigger one tomorrow,&quot; one delaer told Reuters.</p>
<p>Trade totalled 22.3 million kuna at 1030 local (0930 GMT), against some 52 million on offer. The largest part comprised short-term deals struck at 11 percent and one 30-day loan was made at 15 percent.</p>
<p>Overnight trade over the weekend totalled 15.067 million kuna which went to six banks. -- Metka Jelenc, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
